  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Creatures caught in your grasp are struck with mortal terror.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Final Embrace Horror<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A creature that takes damage from your constrict attack is also frightened until the start of your next turn. If you constrict a non-mythic creature, this effect lasts for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1 round) after the creature last takes damage from your constrict attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc120\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
